sequenceDiagram
    participant Catalog
    participant Topo
    participant Reconciler as ReplicaGroupService / Plan + Membership Reconciler
    participant Leader as Storage Leader
    participant NewNode as New Storage Node

    Catalog->>Topo: AlterTableReplicaCount(replica_count=4)
    Topo->>Topo: TablePhase=RESIZING, TableSpec.replica_count=4
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: PlanReconciler, group.target_replica_count=4
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: MembershipReconciler, healthy_count=3 vs target=4
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: create new Replica metadata, desired=PRESENT phase=CREATING, member_type=NON_MEMBER
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: add new rid into desired_members

    NewNode->>Topo: Heartbeat(no new replica)
    Topo-->>NewNode: PRESENT(new replica), initial_members=desired_members
    NewNode->>NewNode: create local replica
    NewNode->>Topo: Heartbeat(new replica READY, NON_MEMBER)

    Leader->>Topo: Heartbeat(leader)
    Topo-->>Leader: ADD_MEMBER(new replica)
    Leader->>Leader: Raft config change, add new replica as member
    NewNode->>Topo: Heartbeat(new replica READY, VOTER)

    Reconciler->>Reconciler: all desired members READY+VOTER
    Topo->>Topo: TablePhase RESIZING → READY
